flowchart LR
  U[Field Sales User] -->|HTTPS| FE[Streamlit / React Frontend]
  subgraph INTERNET[Public Network Boundary]
    FE
  end
  FE -->|HTTPS + JWT| API[FastAPI API]
  subgraph APP[Private Application Boundary]
    API --> AUTH[Auth / RBAC]
    API --> RAG[RAG Orchestrator]
    RAG --> VDB[(Vector DB<br/>pgvector / Qdrant)]
    RAG --> OBS[Logs + Evaluation]
  end
  RAG -->|API call| LLM[LLM Provider]
  RAG -->|API call| EMB[Embedding Provider]
  subgraph DATA[Data Boundary]
    OBJ[(Object Storage<br/>PDFs)]
    ING[Ingestion Worker]
    OBJ --> ING --> EMB
    EMB --> VDB
  end
  LLM --> RAG
